<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Rural Props year profit slips, no div.</title>
<headline>NZ Rural Props year profit slips, no div.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 0.841 vs 0.923</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				  4.8 vs 5.3</p>
<p>    Turnover				    5.28 vs 6.13</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     1.19 vs 1.14</p>
<p>    Tax					  0.349 vs 0.213</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	  17.4 vs same</p>
<p>Note - New Zealand Rural Properties is a corporate farming business. The company said no dividend was declared pending the outcome of the proposed takeover by Williams and Kettle, which has the support of both boards and will be voted on at an Extraordinary General Meeting on August 30.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
